{{define "title"}}Your Chronos deletion request has been cancelled{{end}}
{{define "content"}}
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">Hello{{if .Name}} {{.Name}}{{end}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">The request to delete your Chronos account has been
  <strong>cancelled</strong>. Your account and everything in it are unchanged, and nothing
  will be erased.</p>
{{if .ByAnotherParty}}<p style="margin:0 0 14px;">This was done by an administrator rather
  than from your own account.</p>{{end}}
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">If you still want your account deleted, you can request it again
  from your account settings. If you did not request the cancellation and cannot explain it,
  change your password and review your active sessions — someone else may have access to
  your account.</p>
{{end}}
